# Architecture & WhatsFeed Core

## Dependency Rule

```
presentation → application → domain
                    ↑
infrastructure ─────┘
```

**Domain has NO dependencies on other layers** (no Nest/Next/Expo/HTTP/DB imports).

## Monorepo Layout

```
apps/web          # Next.js (Instagram-style feed)
apps/admin        # Next.js admin
apps/mobile       # Expo / React Native
services/server   # NestJS API (:3001, prefix /api/v1)
services/recommendation
services/vision
services/rag
services/media-gen
packages/*        # shared-types, im, analytics
```

Clients (web / mobile / admin) call **only** NestJS. Do not call Python microservices or explore-ai from the browser.

## Layers (TypeScript)

| Layer | Contains | Typical paths |
|-------|----------|---------------|
| `domain/` | Entities, VOs, repository/gateway interfaces | `*/src/domain/` |
| `application/` | Use cases, application services, DTOs | `*/src/application/` |
| `infrastructure/` | Adapters, HTTP clients, persistence, config | `*/src/infrastructure/` |
| `presentation/` | Controllers, UI, Nest modules that expose HTTP | `*/src/presentation/` or `apps/*/app/` |

### NestJS (`services/server`)

```
services/server/src/
├── domain/
├── application/
├── infrastructure/
└── presentation/     # controllers, guards, filters
```

Global API prefix: `/api/v1`.

### Web (`apps/web`)

Business-domain folders (Redux retained; no Clean Architecture layers):

```
apps/web/src/
├── core/       # api-client, storage, websocket, rtc, Redux store, config, mock-data
├── shared/     # emotion, i18n, utils, shared UI (ui/)
├── layout/     # authenticated-shell, nav, providers, routing helpers
├── auth/       # auth.api, auth-session, use-auth, user.model
├── feed/       # feed.api, use-feed, feed-page, feed components
├── chat/       # chat.api, messages-page, chat components, slices hooks
├── explore/    # explore-page
├── reels/      # reels-page
├── search/     # search containers, global search hooks
├── profile/    # profile-page, user.api, use-user-profile*
├── calls/      # call UI, calls slice hooks, WebRTC usage
├── ai/         # ai/voice/image/video/vision/file apis, AI dialogs
└── secondary/  # settings, status, starred
```

Import aliases: `@/core/*`, `@/auth/*`, `@/feed/*`, … (see `apps/web/tsconfig.json`).

